@.str.100 = private unnamed_addr constant [259 x i8] c"Generate a matrix transformation that rotates the mesh so that the selection fits one of the main planes XY YZ ZX. May also translate such that the selection centroid rest on the origin. It reports on the log the average error of the fitting (in mesh units).\00", align 1
@.str.101 = private unnamed_addr constant [334 x i8] c"Generate a matrix transformation that rotates the mesh aligning it to its principal axis of inertia.If the mesh is watertight the Itertia tensor is computed assuming the interior of the mesh has a uniform density.In case of an open mesh or a point clouds the inerta tensor is computed assuming each vertex is a constant puntual mass.\00", align 1
